        "created_at": "2024-03-18T14:41:33.490Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Rymdkejsaren\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"30671\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rymdkejsaren/48/6369_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rymdkejsaren:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So for the first example, that must mean that you <strong>have</strong> to push 3, whether you like it or not?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, unless it says “You may Push 3 <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0d84df877d3b8126f6cdb24f2a433ca4ed09111e.png?v=12\" title=\":dahan:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":dahan:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">,” in which case you can push 0 or 3.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Rymdkejsaren\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"30671\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rymdkejsaren/48/6369_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rymdkejsaren:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Second, I assume based on the <em>do as much as you can</em> principle that I can still target a land that has <em>fewer</em> than 3 Dahan with that power?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, unless the effect said, “If there are at least 3 <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0d84df877d3b8126f6cdb24f2a433ca4ed09111e.png?v=12\" title=\":dahan:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":dahan:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> in target land, Push them.”</p>",
